## How Far in Advance to Book

All our bookings need at least 24 hours' notice, and the fog machine is no exception. The constraint that actually needs lead time is not ours, it is the venue's: getting written confirmation that the detection zone can be isolated can take days if it has to go through a hotel's technical department. Ask early, book late.

## Conclusion

Smoke machine rental in Malaga, from us, means one Martin Magnum 650 added to an [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) or a [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) for 20 euros, to make the lighting you are already renting actually visible.

Confirm with your venue that the smoke detection can be isolated, and tell us what you are lighting. If the answer from the venue is no, we will say so and build the look with light alone.

[Contact us](/contact/) with your venue and your date, or call us on [666 346 911](tel:+34666346911).

## FAQs

### How much does a smoke machine cost to rent in Malaga?

Twenty euros, added to a package rather than rented alone. It is an option on the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) at 290 euros ex VAT and the [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) at 650 euros ex VAT.

### Will the smoke machine set off the fire alarm?

It can, and that is the normal behaviour of an optical smoke detector rather than a fault. Ask your venue whether the detection zone can be isolated for the event and who is authorised to do it, before you book the add on. We cannot isolate a detector ourselves, because fire detection is the venue's system and their responsibility.

### Do you offer the low lying fog effect for a first dance?

Not with our own equipment. That cloud on the floor look needs a chilled fog or dry ice machine, which is not in our own inventory. Our Martin Magnum 650 produces fog that rises and spreads rather than staying at ankle height. Tell us you want it and we will look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one.

### Can you do coloured smoke for a gender reveal?

Not with our own machine, which makes white fog only. Coloured smoke comes from smoke grenades, powder cannons or pyrotechnic sticks, a different product family that is not in our own inventory. Tell us what you need and we will look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one. With our own RGBW fixtures we can also light the reveal area in pink or blue.

### Do you rent a haze machine?

Not from our own inventory: we stock fog, not haze. Fog is visible white cloud that drifts and thins, haze is a near invisible mist that hangs for hours. If your production specifically needs haze, tell us and we will look for a solution with our suppliers, if there is one.

### How many smoke machines do you have?

One. It covers a dancefloor, a stage or a presentation area well. Filling a large hall evenly takes several machines placed around the room. Those are not in our own inventory, but tell us the room and we will look for the extra machines with our suppliers, if they are available.

### Can the smoke machine be used outdoors?

It can be powered and run outdoors, but fog disperses in seconds in any wind, so the effect is usually not worth the setup unless the area is genuinely sheltered. Tell us the space and we will say honestly whether it is worth the 20 euros.

### Is the fog machine synchronised with the lighting?

Not automatically. Our lighting is controlled by foot pedal and aimed by hand rather than by DMX, so there is no programmed cue stack. A technician triggers the fog by hand at the moment you want it, which works well for an entrance or a first dance.
